ve reaction — the format appears to be standard and expected.\n\n---\n\n**Verification of Answer ‘2’: “Adopted the method of broadcasting and connecting awards”**\n\n✅ **Correct.**  \nThe evidence overwhelmingly supports that the presentation **adopted the method of broadcasting and connecting awards**. The format is not in-person (recipients are not on the main stage), not telephone (no audio-only interaction), and not a simple video call (it’s a multi-camera, professionally produced broadcast with split-screen feeds connecting multiple physical locations). The awards are physically handed over in the recipients’ local venues, while the ceremony is broadcast to a global audience and synchronized with the main stage.\n\nThis hybrid broadcast model allows for simultaneous recognition across locations while maintaining the ceremonial gravity of the event.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**  \n✅ The answer **“2) Adopted the method of broadcasting and connecting awards”** is **correct** and fully supported by the visual evidence.\n', '\n=== Batch 30-60 (30 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_0769.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1810.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1811.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1812.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1813.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1814.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1815.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1816.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1817.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1818.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1819.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/8NHmfpkxTSw/frames/frame_1820.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_pr